Hello,

Yes, you can use the "domain" argument in GribGrab.  This will only
download data from a latitude longitude box that you define.  You can also
set the "domain" argument in ReadGrib to only read data in a certain
location.

This is explained in the package help files, and I think some examples use
them.

Best,

Danny
